_paragraph\" >After over a year hidden from the public eye, reclusive tech CEO Tom Ballinger, pioneer of revolutionary &quot;fungus powered&quot; technology, has invited <i>YOU</i> to his isolated estate in the New Zealand wilderness for an exclusive interview and a glimpse of his next big project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Away at a conference, he allows you to stay in his woodland cabin, all alone... Though he won't stop texting you strange requests...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941990/extras/a8ff9f213d9f8de796fa3bc97609df13.avif?t=1772099918\" width=1240 height=590 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have three days before the interview.\u00a0Just you, your phone camera, and a property full of secrets, waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might be able to save your career, but can you save yourself from what you find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENJOY YOUR STAY\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941990/extras/73d9f6ccc6342ece62ee95e9c8c6babc.avif?t=1772099918\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941990/extras_big/73d9f6ccc6342ece62ee95e9c8c6babc.avif?t=1772099918 width=1600 height=784 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate</strong> - Explore Ballinger's cabin, taking photos with your phone and documenting discoveries on your clue board.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel</strong> - Follow the clues and slowly unravel the mystery of Tom's &quot;innovative&quot; mycelial technology and his strange behaviour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expose</strong> - Find out the truth behind his next big project, and expose it for the world to see... if you can make it out alive.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric setting with a lo-fi pixelated aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive clue board system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phone camera and torch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive texts from NPCs</p></li></ul>","developers":["Studio 8-Track"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941990/6d52b6706ccaadcf3f028b15feeff97876e1d90c/header.jpg?t=1772099918","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2941990/1897579978/c557a8dd4b290fa3766d276bfaf450a943124f05/1771754969/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771755413","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2941990/1897579978/c557a8dd4b290fa3766d276bfaf450a943124f05/1771754969/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771755413","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2941990/1897579978/c557a8dd4b290fa3766d276bfaf450a943124f05/1771754969/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771755413","id":257292099,"name":"Unhomely Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257292099/01e491d240bc5c1eef80736c05d2237b1ee2f77a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771755413"}],"name":"Unhomely","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><s